    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented two-bedroom mid-terrace house, located in the established Lahard residential area and within walking distance of all shops & schools within the popular waterside town of Ballinamore.\n\nOriginally built circa 1948 and renovated in 2005, this attractive property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal home for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or as an excellent investment opportunity.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, comfortable living room, kitchen/dining room, guest toilet, main bathroom and two good-sized bedrooms. Both bedrooms benefit from built-in wardrobes, while the main bedroom also features an ensuite shower room.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a beautifully maintained garden, providing a pleasant and private outdoor space that is ideal for relaxing or enjoying the warmer months. The property also benefits from solar panels to the roof, oil-fired central heating and a BER rating of C.\n\nSituated within easy walking distance of Ballinamore town centre, the property is ideally located for access to the town's wide range of shops, supermarkets, cafés, pubs, restaurants and everyday amenities, while also being convenient to the area's many recreational and leisure facilities.\n\nA property of this quality and location is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. Viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\nWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to the main living accommodation.\n\nLiving Room\nComfortable reception room.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room\nCombined kitchen and dining area with access towards the rear of the property.\n\nGuest Toilet\nWC and wash hand basin.\n\nMain Bathroom\nFully fitted bathroom.\n\nBedroom 1\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes and ensuite.\n\nBedroom 2\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented throughout\nExcellent condition\nTwo good-sized bedrooms\nEnsuite to main bedroom\nBuilt-in wardrobes to both bedrooms\nRenovated in 2005\nBER Rating C\nSolar panels\nOil-fired central heating\nBeautifully maintained rear garden\nWalking distance of Ballinamore town centre\nIdeal first-time buyer, downsizer or investment property"
      },
